{#-
    Dependency catalog for generated projects: the single place a dependency version is written down.

    - package.json, .nvmrc, `packageManager`, CI workflows and every other rendered file read versions from here.
    - Renovate keeps this file current (custom managers in /renovate.json): one line = one dependency.
    - Existing projects receive changes through `copier update` (template update PR) or their own Renovate.

    Keep it valid JSON between the `set` delimiters (scripts parse it), one `"name": "version"` pair per line.
-#}
